 stem:`A suture pad, needle holder, tissue forceps, scissors and a pre-loaded non-absorbable suture are provided.<br>1. Place <b>one vertical mattress stitch</b> on the pad and tie it using an <b>instrument tie</b>.<br>2. Using a <b>one-handed technique</b>, tie a knot that brings the two rubber pieces provided into contact.`,
